{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade Shoot'em Up Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose from 1 of 3 different weapons frames :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/3ExilusFrames.gif?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each frame has 15 weapon tiers to progress through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Based Stage Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through the 8 stages, via 8 different routes, in a challenge based \u201cOutrun-lite\u201d progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/RouteCombo.gif?t=1746897552\" /><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Collisions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVplayerCol.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player hit box is the smaller central diamond (A.I. cluster shard)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UI Tags</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EValertTypes.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid enemy bullets, (bullet behaviours represented through shape, animation, and color).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will not take\u00a0damage from collisions with enemy hit boxes,\u00a0 (&quot;Target&quot; UI tag).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will take damage when colliding with highlighted environmental objects, (&quot;Warning&quot; UI tag).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Hull Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVdamage.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose 1 HP per instance\u00a0of damage taken</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain 1 HP via stage selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain an additional 2 HP when selecting easier stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EV1cc.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>NO CONTINUES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>When your HP reaches zero, your current run will end, and your score will be registered.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scoring</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVscoring.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain based score multiplier - Keep your chain alive for higher scoring runs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Rarity based score bonuses - Tougher enemies = More scoring!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exilus Beam (Super)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge your Exilus Beam (super) by defeating enemies with your Primary Weapon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVcombatGifx.gif?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the power of the Exilus Beam and leave your lesser enemies in ruin, or make tactical bullet cancels against tougher foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access and Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Exilus Viper is our first game</u></strong>, and therefore it will take plenty of additional work and updates before we will consider it ready for full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obviously we will greatly benefit by receiving feedback from our players, as we do our best to balance and refine the base game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following is a very rough \u201c<strong>Seasonal Roadmap</strong>\u201d of our intentions during early access :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/RoadMap01.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plans inevitably change, especially when considering community feedback, but we feel our <strong>Seasonal Roadmap</strong> should be achievable given our progress up to this point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please head to our Community Hub here on Steam - and share your thoughts on Exilus Viper, and we will do our best to continue improving the game, and incorporate your feedback!<br><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beyond Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preliminary work has already begun on a sequel to EV, and we also have plans to expand our universe into other genres, but these things take a serious back seat during EV\u2019s early access period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627590?t=1746897552","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3627590?t=1746897552","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/89f6a948d02f665d1780355e86c9b11b3a9ed1d3/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1746897552","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/89f6a948d02f665d1780355e86c9b11b3a9ed1d3/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1746897552","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Full controller support","id":28},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Arcade Shoot'em Up Combat</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Choose from 1 of 3 different weapons frames :</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">\u00a0 \u00a0<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/3ExilusFrames.gif?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Each frame has 15 weapon tiers to progress through.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Challenge Based Stage Progression</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Blast your way through the 8 stages, via 8 different routes, in a challenge based \u201cOutrun-lite\u201d progression system.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> <br><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/RouteCombo.gif?t=1746897552\" /><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Gameplay Mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Collisions</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVplayerCol.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Player hit box is the smaller central diamond (A.I. cluster shard)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>UI Tags</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EValertTypes.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Avoid enemy bullets, (bullet behaviours represented through shape, animation, and color).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will not take\u00a0damage from collisions with enemy hit boxes,\u00a0 (&quot;Target&quot; UI tag).</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">You will take damage when colliding with highlighted environmental objects, (&quot;Warning&quot; UI tag).</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Player Hull Points</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVdamage.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Lose 1 HP per instance\u00a0of damage taken</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain 1 HP via stage selection</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Gain an additional 2 HP when selecting easier stages</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EV1cc.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>NO CONTINUES</u></strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><i>When your HP reaches zero, your current run will end, and your score will be registered.</i></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Scoring</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVscoring.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Chain based score multiplier - Keep your chain alive for higher scoring runs!</p></li></ul><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Enemy Rarity based score bonuses - Tougher enemies = More scoring!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Exilus Beam (Super)</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Charge your Exilus Beam (super) by defeating enemies with your Primary Weapon</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/EVcombatGifx.gif?t=1746897552\" /></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Unleash the power of the Exilus Beam and leave your lesser enemies in ruin, or make tactical bullet cancels against tougher foes!</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Early Access and Roadmap</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong><u>Exilus Viper is our first game</u></strong>, and therefore it will take plenty of additional work and updates before we will consider it ready for full release.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Obviously we will greatly benefit by receiving feedback from our players, as we do our best to balance and refine the base game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The following is a very rough \u201c<strong>Seasonal Roadmap</strong>\u201d of our intentions during early access :</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/extras/RoadMap01.png?t=1746897552\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Plans inevitably change, especially when considering community feedback, but we feel our <strong>Seasonal Roadmap</strong> should be achievable given our progress up to this point.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Please head to our Community Hub here on Steam - and share your thoughts on Exilus Viper, and we will do our best to continue improving the game, and incorporate your feedback!<br><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\">Beyond Early Access</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Preliminary work has already begun on a sequel to EV, and we also have plans to expand our universe into other genres, but these things take a serious back seat during EV\u2019s early access period.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><u>\u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0</u></p>","developers":["polygon workshops"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/d99e7f63e26a58651f4f698f5cdd5c94adf0386c/header.jpg?t=1746897552","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257130016,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130016/movie480.mp4?t=1746481019","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130016/movie_max.mp4?t=1746481019"},"name":"EV Early Access Trailer","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257130016/72aa5dc3571de686230a1a427ac06c313798832f/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1746481019","webm":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130016/movie480_vp9.webm?t=1746481019","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257130016/movie_max_vp9.webm?t=1746481019"}}],"name":"Exilus Viper","package_groups":[],"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core2 Duo<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 2000 MB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Shader Model 3<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 9.0c<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1000 MB available space</li></ul>"},"platforms":{"linux":false,"mac":false,"windows":true},"publishers":["polygon workshops"],"ratings":{"dejus":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Viol\u00eancia","rating":"10","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"10","use_age_gate":"0"},"steam_germany":{"banned":"0","descriptors":"Gewalt","rating":"12","rating_generated":"1","required_age":"12","use_age_gate":"0"}},"release_date":{"coming_soon":true,"date":"28 May, 2025"},"required_age":0,"screenshots":[{"id":0,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/a6b965da7f8e14ac57b5f692253cdbbeac35b94b/ss_a6b965da7f8e14ac57b5f692253cdbbeac35b94b.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/a6b965da7f8e14ac57b5f692253cdbbeac35b94b/ss_a6b965da7f8e14ac57b5f692253cdbbeac35b94b.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"},{"id":1,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/3aa134543106caf44e374463a32501d9bcf204bb/ss_3aa134543106caf44e374463a32501d9bcf204bb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/3aa134543106caf44e374463a32501d9bcf204bb/ss_3aa134543106caf44e374463a32501d9bcf204bb.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"},{"id":2,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/3949ea7439a3937ae3604f3c7757f3d10bf0c201/ss_3949ea7439a3937ae3604f3c7757f3d10bf0c201.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/3949ea7439a3937ae3604f3c7757f3d10bf0c201/ss_3949ea7439a3937ae3604f3c7757f3d10bf0c201.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"},{"id":3,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/525a75cdd9c275d6532e6201082a8b359ff783c3/ss_525a75cdd9c275d6532e6201082a8b359ff783c3.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/525a75cdd9c275d6532e6201082a8b359ff783c3/ss_525a75cdd9c275d6532e6201082a8b359ff783c3.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"},{"id":4,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/b86e8a45c2efeea80e6ead74a89bf9d595670d8d/ss_b86e8a45c2efeea80e6ead74a89bf9d595670d8d.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/b86e8a45c2efeea80e6ead74a89bf9d595670d8d/ss_b86e8a45c2efeea80e6ead74a89bf9d595670d8d.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"},{"id":5,"path_full":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/bb2a25e222b22fdf1753e90de9c94360ed3328d5/ss_bb2a25e222b22fdf1753e90de9c94360ed3328d5.1920x1080.jpg?t=1746897552","path_thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3627590/bb2a25e222b22fdf1753e90de9c94360ed3328d5/ss_bb2a25e222b22fdf1753e90de9c94360ed3328d5.600x338.jpg?t=1746897552"}],"short_description":"Awaken as the Nav Shard\u2014one of five A.I. fragments aboard a mysterious fighter-jet. Battle through branching stages in a neon-infused vertical shmup. Choose your weapon frame, and fight your way to the Void. No retries. No rewinds. This is Exilus Viper.","steam_appid":3627590,"support_info":{"email":"polygon.workshops@gmail.com","url":""},"supported_languages":"English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support","type":"game","website":null}